    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre-Purchase Offer</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Tony's Creepy Crawly Zoo 2.0</i>! This is the full virtual reality experience, offering a deep dive into the immersive world of insects and reptiles. Your support helps us continue expanding and enriching this groundbreaking educational adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/c3ddbdee5f4d825fc604bae5ed72bd80.poster.avif?t=1744222123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/c3ddbdee5f4d825fc604bae5ed72bd80.webm?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/c3ddbdee5f4d825fc604bae5ed72bd80.mp4?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.poster.avif?t=1744222123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.webm?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.mp4?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the captivating world of <strong>Tony's Creepy Crawly Zoo 2.0</strong>, where science and adventure collide! This immersive VR experience lets you explore a vibrant insect science museum filled with live insects and reptiles in stunning macro detail. Shrink to their scale and discover the intricate beauty of their world like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience also includes a special room showcasing the legendary <i>Dan Capps Exhibit</i>, one of the world's most extensive insect collections, with over 100 meticulously curated display cases. In this immersive exhibit, experience video recordings of Dan Capps himself, as he pops up throughout the room to guide you through the fascinating world of entomology. Whether you\u2019re marveling at the intricacy of insect anatomy or learning about the rare species Dan has collected, this experience brings the hidden wonders of nature right to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for science enthusiasts and curious explorers, this immersive experience offers an unforgettable introduction to the rich biodiversity of our planet\u2019s insects and reptiles\u2014all from the comfort of your own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.poster.avif?t=1744222123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.webm?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.mp4?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.poster.avif?t=1744222123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.webm?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/fe8359e3e4a7c0220df7e5f87b0425f0.mp4?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the captivating world of <strong>Tony's Creepy Crawly Zoo 2.0</strong>, where science and adventure collide! This immersive VR experience lets you explore a vibrant insect science museum filled with live insects and reptiles in stunning macro detail. Shrink to their scale and discover the intricate beauty of their world like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The experience also includes a special room showcasing the legendary <i>Dan Capps Exhibit</i>, one of the world's most extensive insect collections, with over 100 meticulously curated display cases. In this immersive exhibit, experience video recordings of Dan Capps himself, as he pops up throughout the room to guide you through the fascinating world of entomology. Whether you\u2019re marveling at the intricacy of insect anatomy or learning about the rare species Dan has collected, this experience brings the hidden wonders of nature right to your fingertips.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for science enthusiasts and curious explorers, this immersive experience offers an unforgettable introduction to the rich biodiversity of our planet\u2019s insects and reptiles\u2014all from the comfort of your own space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.poster.avif?t=1744222123\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.webm?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337280/extras/ec70789b7db84ada916ee35980c702b5.mp4?t=1744222123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
